  <li><strong>NASA Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter (LRO) CRaTER Data Archive</strong> — <a href="https://crater-web.sr.unh.edu/">https://crater-web.sr.unh.edu/</a> (Spence, H. E., et al., 2010, <em>Space Science Reviews</em>)</li>
  <li><strong>NASA Mars Science Laboratory (Curiosity) RAD Surface Dosimetry</strong> — Hassler, D. M., et al. (2014). <em>Mars' Surface Radiation Environment Measured with the Mars Science Laboratory's Curiosity Rover</em>. Science, 343(6169), 1244797.</li>
  <li><strong>International Commission on Radiological Protection (ICRP)</strong> — ICRP Publication 60 (1991) &amp; Publication 103 (2007): <em>Linear Energy Transfer Quality Factors Q(LET) and Equivalent Dose Weighting</em>.</li>
  <li><strong>Radiotrophic Fungal Melanin Space Shielding Benchmarks</strong> — Shunk, G. K., Gomez, X. R., &amp; Averesch, N. J. H. (2020). <em>A Self-Replicating Radiation-Shield for Human Spaceflight: Radiotrophic Fungi on the International Space Station</em>; Dadachova, E., et al. (2007), <em>PLOS ONE</em>.</li>
  <li><strong>Gadolinium-157 Neutron Capture &amp; NASA OSDR RadLab</strong> — ENDF/B-VIII.0 Nuclear Data Library (157Gd thermal neutron capture cross-section = 255,000 barns) &amp; NASA Open Science Data Repository — <a href="https://osdr.nasa.gov/">https://osdr.nasa.gov/</a></li>
</ol>
<p>These resources are proposed research sources. The specific datasets and simulation products used in the final implementation will be selected after reviewing their availability, documentation, and suitability for the research objectives.</p>

